                  color: AppColors.shiftAfternoon.withValues(alpha: 0.1),
                  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
                ),
                child: const Icon(
                  Icons.wb_twilight,
                  color: AppColors.shiftAfternoon,
                  size: 32,
